WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:04.777
(Day 2 of filming MV of 'Pretty Please' MV)
(Hearts2Hearts moved to the rooftop)

00:00:04.778 --> 00:00:09.117
We're heading to the next
filming site, to the rooftop here

00:00:09.118 --> 00:00:12.456
I got changed to a different outfit
and got different hairstyle too

00:00:12.457 --> 00:00:16.453
Think I can see the hair color
better with my hair down

00:00:16.454 --> 00:00:17.921
Ayyyy

00:00:17.922 --> 00:00:20.701
But I feel satisfied

00:00:20.702 --> 00:00:25.793
Heard it's decorated with H2H over there,
let me show you

00:00:25.794 --> 00:00:28.777
(Wall graffiti with H2H)
Can you see it? H2H

00:00:28.778 --> 00:00:33.350
Can't believe they decorated it for us like that

00:00:33.351 --> 00:00:36.962
Gotta do our best filming for it

00:00:36.963 --> 00:00:39.244
There's a group choreography scene
at the rooftop

00:00:39.245 --> 00:00:41.281
We'll do our best

00:00:41.282 --> 00:00:43.935
(This was filmed while the car has stopped)
Today, we're on our day 2 of our 'Pretty Please' MV

00:00:43.936 --> 00:00:46.439
Today's highlight! The freckles makeup

00:00:46.440 --> 00:00:49.525
I wasn't so used to this hair color
at first

00:00:49.526 --> 00:00:52.468
I was worried if I'd look good
in the hair

00:00:52.469 --> 00:00:55.831
but I felt I was able to show you something new

00:00:55.832 --> 00:00:58.116
So hope you guys like it

00:00:58.117 --> 00:00:59.944
After debut, I thought I'd get it down to

00:00:59.945 --> 00:01:03.987
one animal, on my animal look alike

00:01:03.988 --> 00:01:06.929
but it's odd how the more
the time goes, the harder it gets

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:11.718
But what's for sure is, I never
heard I look like a dog

00:01:11.719 --> 00:01:13.989
But I've been getting dog as my look alike too

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:15.494
Think I have 5

00:01:15.495 --> 00:01:18.491
(JIWOO's animal look alike)
Dog, cat, bunny, weasel, deer

00:01:18.492 --> 00:01:19.218
What else

00:01:19.219 --> 00:01:20.406
Beluga whale

00:01:20.407 --> 00:01:23.510
It's not like tilted a lot towards
one of them

00:01:23.511 --> 00:01:26.185
but they're really like evenly split

00:01:26.186 --> 00:01:27.555
What are we going to do

00:01:27.556 --> 00:01:30.220
S2U can't agree on it

00:01:30.221 --> 00:01:33.300
(S2U, please be united and choose one for me)
What do you think?

00:01:33.301 --> 00:01:34.585
(Then bye)

00:01:35.970 --> 00:01:39.266
(Waiting to film, started blue sky milky way)
You just do it with telepathy

00:01:39.267 --> 00:01:40.209
Right

00:01:40.210 --> 00:01:41.908
(So good!)
Just gotta do it

00:01:41.909 --> 00:01:44.622
(Missed the telepathy signal)

00:01:44.623 --> 00:01:46.151
What's your concept for today?

00:01:46.152 --> 00:01:49.001
(Simple)
Today? It's Pokemon concept

00:01:49.002 --> 00:01:50.389
Hey, A-NA!

00:01:50.929 --> 00:01:52.489
Are you watching me?

00:01:52.489 --> 00:01:53.397
(Feeling big)

00:01:53.398 --> 00:01:55.068
Thank ya always

00:01:55.069 --> 00:01:56.543
(Tap on the shoulders)
Same!

00:01:56.544 --> 00:01:57.751
(Cute)

00:01:57.752 --> 00:01:59.626
Will say it again while I'm here

00:01:59.627 --> 00:02:01.106
Thanks, A-NA

00:02:01.107 --> 00:02:03.119
(Ta-da)

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:05.081
(Ta-da)
Nature!

00:02:05.082 --> 00:02:07.798
(Skit vibes again)
I come here once in a while

00:02:07.799 --> 00:02:09.024
I come here to hike

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:12.738
(This is what you call)
Self-discipline at its finest

00:02:12.739 --> 00:02:16.261
(Loving the view)
(selfie time)

00:02:16.262 --> 00:02:17.508
(Suddenly done)
Bye

00:02:35.010 --> 00:02:36.915
(Proud)
Hearts2Hearts did so well just now

00:02:36.916 --> 00:02:39.003
(Oh my...)

00:02:40.804 --> 00:02:43.217
The weather's getting better and better

00:02:43.218 --> 00:02:45.125
Think it's because it's in the afternoon

00:02:45.126 --> 00:02:46.051
(Get cool, weather)

00:02:46.052 --> 00:02:48.983
This is a behind the scenes
story on practice, for verse 1

00:02:48.984 --> 00:02:51.753
'How it's so simple', this part

00:02:51.754 --> 00:02:53.608
Our members make a door for me like that

00:02:53.609 --> 00:02:56.085
and I hop over them, there's a part like that

00:02:56.086 --> 00:03:00.814
But when we were practicing, our members
won't open the door

00:03:00.815 --> 00:03:03.465
(Save YE-ON, members teasing)
So I remember I couldn't hop over

00:03:03.466 --> 00:03:05.942
When we do them at like music shows

00:03:05.943 --> 00:03:08.705
I'll be in trouble if they do that
on music shows

00:03:14.356 --> 00:03:15.981
Dance with me

00:03:15.982 --> 00:03:17.273
(Going to get makeup fixed)
Sorry!

00:03:17.274 --> 00:03:19.333
(Funsies)
STELLA, sit

00:03:19.334 --> 00:03:20.766
(Walk walk...)

00:03:20.767 --> 00:03:22.154
(Hmmph)

00:03:37.094 --> 00:03:40.010
So pretty, great job, cut!

00:03:40.011 --> 00:03:43.149
Talalalalalaa

00:03:43.150 --> 00:03:45.074
(Showing the view)

00:03:45.075 --> 00:03:47.960
(Capture time)

00:03:47.961 --> 00:03:50.812
Just had some capture time

00:03:50.813 --> 00:03:55.184
(And leaving a selfie too)

00:03:55.185 --> 00:03:57.437
(Ay)
It's so pretty here

00:03:57.438 --> 00:03:59.771
STELLA's way of taking a selfie

00:03:59.772 --> 00:04:04.275
(Press the shutter multiple times)

00:04:05.176 --> 00:04:07.238
Think I took enough

00:04:07.239 --> 00:04:10.516
I have to take this hat off
when we film the group choreography

00:04:10.517 --> 00:04:13.177
so I'll be taking off the hat soon

00:04:13.178 --> 00:04:14.711
Bye, bye, blue hat

00:04:14.712 --> 00:04:17.527
Then I'll be back after filming
the group choreography

00:04:17.528 --> 00:04:19.558
S2U, hello

00:04:19.559 --> 00:04:21.932
This is IANTube's IANTV(?)

00:04:21.933 --> 00:04:25.396
(Sharing tips) I'll be sharing tips
on how to take good selfies

00:04:25.397 --> 00:04:28.800
Many S2U have asked me on how
to take good selfies

00:04:28.801 --> 00:04:30.710
(1. Get the phone ready)
Get the phone ready first

00:04:30.711 --> 00:04:34.081
(2. Find the angle that looks good)
And you have to find a good angle

00:04:34.082 --> 00:04:39.314
(The details)
For me, I look good on the left, this way

00:04:39.315 --> 00:04:43.628
(The key point) And tilt 45 degrees, to
make the face look as small as possible

00:04:43.629 --> 00:04:46.478
(3. Hold the phone in one hand)
And then hold it with one hand

00:04:46.479 --> 00:04:48.975
(The details)
Holding it with the left hand

00:04:48.976 --> 00:04:51.699
and with the right hand
feel really different

00:04:51.700 --> 00:04:55.928
I wanted to go for that cute and
refreshing vibes

00:04:55.929 --> 00:04:58.273
(hehe)
So I'll hold it with my right hand this time

00:04:58.274 --> 00:05:03.830
(4. Finding the hinderances) The key
for me to see if I get a shadow cast on my face

00:05:03.831 --> 00:05:05.685
and since the lighting is over there

00:05:05.686 --> 00:05:10.048
It's bad to have the phone
by the lighting

00:05:10.049 --> 00:05:13.885
(5. Make a face, I love myself)
You have to look like you're self-absorbed

00:05:13.886 --> 00:05:15.813
That's the biggest key

00:05:17.489 --> 00:05:20.327
Since I wore an overall today

00:05:20.328 --> 00:05:23.020
I'll put my hand inside the pocket here

00:05:23.021 --> 00:05:26.547
(6. and look freely) And it's important to
look away freely as you'd like

00:05:26.548 --> 00:05:29.424
I tend to look this way

00:05:31.037 --> 00:05:32.707
(Checking)

00:05:32.708 --> 00:05:35.826
(Apologize)
Actually never mind, don't do this

00:05:35.827 --> 00:05:37.178
(Coach IAN's selfie as an example)
Want to see one?

00:05:37.179 --> 00:05:38.716
I took one earlier

00:05:38.717 --> 00:05:41.578
(Go away sunlight.jpg)
As if I'm blocking the sunlight

00:05:41.579 --> 00:05:43.372
(Directing) A bit like this

00:05:43.373 --> 00:05:44.183
(And coaching how to get picture taken)

00:05:46.698 --> 00:05:48.852
(Silence)

00:05:48.853 --> 00:05:51.500
(But let's just do it together)

00:05:51.501 --> 00:05:52.629
Stand straight

00:05:52.630 --> 00:05:53.936
(Too bent)
Too bent right now

00:05:53.937 --> 00:05:55.229
Not all the way this way

00:05:55.230 --> 00:05:55.920
Let's do it around here

00:05:55.921 --> 00:05:56.795
Start

00:05:56.796 --> 00:05:58.705
(Laughing just the right amount like)

00:05:58.706 --> 00:05:59.872
(Is this right?)

00:05:59.873 --> 00:06:00.684
Really can't do this

00:06:00.685 --> 00:06:02.257
Gotta protect IAN!

00:06:02.258 --> 00:06:03.550
S2U, sorry, but don't watch that

00:06:03.551 --> 00:06:05.824
I'm a princess today

00:06:05.825 --> 00:06:07.508
(Sassy)
What are you talking about

00:06:07.509 --> 00:06:08.849
I'm the princess

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:11.257
(Princess dance time)

00:06:11.258 --> 00:06:12.685
(Please)
Don't do it!

00:06:14.204 --> 00:06:15.420
(Cuz I have to do it)

00:06:15.421 --> 00:06:16.865
(Can't stand it)
We'll hang out over here

00:06:16.866 --> 00:06:19.711
YE-ON keeps on following me

00:06:19.712 --> 00:06:21.566
That's because I like you, sis

00:06:21.567 --> 00:06:26.844
(Jealous) Heard rumors that
YUHA's your favorite member

00:06:26.845 --> 00:06:27.774
Let's move on

00:06:27.775 --> 00:06:28.367
(Oh my!)

00:06:28.368 --> 00:06:29.869
(Got the screen over
at just the right time)

00:06:29.870 --> 00:06:34.653
(We're close hehe)

00:06:34.654 --> 00:06:35.969
Unit filming, let's go!

00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:39.836
Pretty

00:06:40.939 --> 00:06:42.225
Feeling emotional

00:06:42.226 --> 00:06:46.216
(Skit mode ON)
(Main character feeling emotional vibes)

00:06:46.217 --> 00:06:47.918
(Acting hard)
I'll get out soon

00:06:47.919 --> 00:06:49.430
I'll get to you soon

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:50.810
So get off me...

00:06:52.253 --> 00:06:55.288
(Feeling sad)
It's over...

00:06:55.289 --> 00:06:58.027
(Got the skit done)

00:06:58.028 --> 00:07:00.835
(Continuing on with)
(Rooftop group choreography scene!)

00:07:26.416 --> 00:07:28.238
(Feedback to each other)
Don't turn on the bottom

00:07:28.239 --> 00:07:30.071
But turn on the line part

00:07:30.072 --> 00:07:33.054
When you go 'you',
I couldn't look back

00:07:33.055 --> 00:07:34.803
so if you leave diagonally
as much as possible

00:07:36.266 --> 00:07:38.346
(Not CG)
(Such nature, such pink sky)

00:07:38.347 --> 00:07:39.265
The sky's so pretty

00:07:41.615 --> 00:07:43.892
(Excited)
So pretty, right?

00:07:43.893 --> 00:07:45.885
Ta-da

00:07:45.886 --> 00:07:49.065
Talalalalalala

00:07:49.066 --> 00:07:52.439
I like youu

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:54.437
The sky's so pretty

00:07:54.438 --> 00:07:57.517
(Weather fairy each time)
Think we get this every time we film for a MV

00:07:57.518 --> 00:07:58.887
Right, it was like this for 'The Chase' too

00:07:58.888 --> 00:08:00.008
Weather fairy?

00:08:16.255 --> 00:08:20.861
(Under the pink sky)
(Done filming for the group choreography!)

00:08:20.862 --> 00:08:23.851
(Suddenly)
Test camera! Film the moon for us please

00:08:25.163 --> 00:08:27.652
In Japanese, 'the moon's beautiful' is

00:08:27.653 --> 00:08:29.859
'Tsuki ga kirei desu ne'

00:08:29.860 --> 00:08:32.505
and heard that's a way of
confessing love

00:08:32.506 --> 00:08:35.159
so I'll go say it to the
Pikachu staff team there

00:08:35.160 --> 00:08:37.689
(YUHA's test camera on)
Follow me

00:08:38.682 --> 00:08:40.599
Hello

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:42.734
(To the staff team)
(suddenly confessing like)

00:08:43.896 --> 00:08:45.435
(Not the reacts she's expected)

00:08:45.436 --> 00:08:46.959
(Plop)
What was that..?

00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.009
Don't think they heard me

00:08:48.010 --> 00:08:49.250
(Feeling rushed)
JIWOO!

00:08:49.251 --> 00:08:50.615
(Will try it once more)

00:08:50.616 --> 00:08:51.588
Tsuki..

00:08:51.589 --> 00:08:53.330
(Suddenly a wrap)
Thank you

00:08:55.091 --> 00:08:56.761
Don't think it's right...

00:08:56.762 --> 00:08:58.675
I was told it's right

00:08:58.676 --> 00:09:00.456
The truth is out there

00:09:00.457 --> 00:09:04.820
(Japanese S2U, help) Japanese S2U, I
heard it's a language of confession, isn't it?

00:09:04.821 --> 00:09:05.894
Okay, that was a fail!

00:09:05.895 --> 00:09:07.166
Thank you!

00:09:07.167 --> 00:09:11.309
(Next scene)
(Will go up the lift and film)

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:13.436
(Going up)

00:09:13.437 --> 00:09:15.646
I'm scared

00:09:15.647 --> 00:09:19.150
Wait, it's quite higher than expected

00:09:19.151 --> 00:09:21.944
(Got to the top)

00:09:21.945 --> 00:09:26.574
(Gotta film this)
(CARMEN here to cheer them)

00:09:26.575 --> 00:09:28.526
Make a pretty pose, please

00:09:28.526 --> 00:09:30.611
(Ayy)

00:09:30.612 --> 00:09:32.362
Air blow, please

00:09:32.363 --> 00:09:34.364
Wait, what if I fly away with the air

00:09:39.535 --> 00:09:43.832
(Turning head once more cool)

00:09:43.833 --> 00:09:46.918
(Arrived well)
I just went up there and came back

00:09:46.919 --> 00:09:48.253
I was there by myself

00:09:48.254 --> 00:09:49.504
It was really scary

00:09:49.505 --> 00:09:53.342
When I saw IAN going on wires when we
filmed 'Butterflies'

00:09:53.343 --> 00:09:56.094
I wanted to try something like that too

00:09:56.095 --> 00:09:59.348
And though it was a bit scary,
it was a good experience

00:09:59.349 --> 00:10:00.974
Think it came out really well

00:10:00.975 --> 00:10:02.517
(Feeling pround, ang)

00:10:02.518 --> 00:10:07.105
(Energy UP!)
(A-NA&amp;JUUN's filming starts!)

00:10:11.317 --> 00:10:13.278
(Bounce bounce)

00:10:15.613 --> 00:10:17.866
(Feeling GOOD)

00:10:17.866 --> 00:10:19.201
(Yay)

00:10:28.751 --> 00:10:30.253
Okay!

00:10:30.254 --> 00:10:33.382
Let's move on to the
group choreography of all 8

00:10:33.383 --> 00:10:34.633
(Short break time before group
dance)(IAN cam ON)

00:10:34.634 --> 00:10:36.426
Hello, everyone

00:10:36.427 --> 00:10:40.806
It's dinner time right now

00:10:40.807 --> 00:10:44.935
so everyone's eating

00:10:44.936 --> 00:10:48.480
I've been eating too much since yesterday

00:10:48.481 --> 00:10:52.067
so I decided skip dinner for today

00:10:52.068 --> 00:10:54.319
(IAN's mukbang(eating) list)
To talk about what I ate yesterday

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:58.699
First of all, I love toasts,
and they had a toast truck for us

00:10:58.700 --> 00:11:01.410
The way I eat it is, I first toast a bread

00:11:01.411 --> 00:11:03.078
and then I put a strawberry jam

00:11:03.079 --> 00:11:06.248
And then I'd dip it in milk

00:11:06.249 --> 00:11:08.083
for like 10 seconds

00:11:08.084 --> 00:11:11.461
Then the toast soaks up the milk,
and it tastes really good

00:11:11.462 --> 00:11:13.088
(Mukbang(eating) list 1. 4 slices of toast)
So I had like 4

00:11:13.089 --> 00:11:17.467
(2. Radish beef soup) And this beef
radish soup with black pepper and rice

00:11:17.468 --> 00:11:20.053
and I had an entire bowl of it
and it was so good

00:11:20.054 --> 00:11:21.638
JUUN was coming when I was eating

00:11:21.639 --> 00:11:26.351
so I was like "JUUN, do you want
to share one more bowl?" so we like

00:11:26.352 --> 00:11:29.104
(Had half more rice bowl)
And had half more

00:11:29.105 --> 00:11:33.775
(4. 3 curry+fish cutlet) And for lunch,
I had 3 servings of curry and fish cutlet

00:11:33.776 --> 00:11:40.991
(5. Bossam(boiled pork belly)&amp;radish kimchi)
Bossam and radish kimchi with rice for dins

00:11:40.992 --> 00:11:46.163
(6. Bingsu (shaved ice) for dessert)
Had 2 mango &amp; 1 red bean shaved ice cups

00:11:46.164 --> 00:11:50.152
I don't feel hungry at all,
so I'm not eating dinner right now

00:11:50.152 --> 00:11:54.045
I eat a lot like this

00:11:54.046 --> 00:11:57.674
(But moves a lot as well) But I exercise
a lot too, and I think I move more than usual

00:11:57.675 --> 00:12:01.928
When other people are just staying
still, I'd go run and move around a lot

00:12:01.929 --> 00:12:03.513
Think I'm physically very active

00:12:03.514 --> 00:12:05.765
(Done with IAN's chat time)
So it's nice

00:12:05.766 --> 00:12:08.185
(This was filmed while the car has stopped)
Guess what this is

00:12:08.186 --> 00:12:10.312
(The novel way of using lighting)

00:12:10.313 --> 00:12:13.190
It's inside a car right now,
but it's too dark

00:12:13.191 --> 00:12:16.610
But since my arms hurt
holding the flash

00:12:16.611 --> 00:12:19.654
so I just put it on my head

00:12:19.655 --> 00:12:20.988
(Shiny)

00:12:20.989 --> 00:12:22.908
But it's so funny having it here

00:12:22.908 --> 00:12:28.205
Apparently, today's the 200th day
since our trailer video

00:12:28.206 --> 00:12:30.165
was revealed at SMTOWN

00:12:30.166 --> 00:12:32.751
(Time to celebrate)
Applause

00:12:32.752 --> 00:12:35.378
But yeah, time really flies

00:12:35.379 --> 00:12:39.174
- It feels like it's been more than 200 days!
- (CARMEN) Yeah

00:12:39.174 --> 00:12:40.967
(Time to go film)
Bye

00:12:40.968 --> 00:12:41.885
(Fell)

00:12:41.886 --> 00:12:44.930
We'll be filming the final scene and
go off from work!

00:12:44.931 --> 00:12:47.140
(Let's cheer up till the end!)

00:12:57.107 --> 00:12:58.652
Great

00:12:59.777 --> 00:13:02.405
(Done with day 2)
(See you tomorrow)

00:13:02.406 --> 00:13:03.796
See you on day 3!

00:13:03.797 --> 00:13:05.742
See you tomorrow!

00:13:05.743 --> 00:13:06.701
Good night!

00:13:06.702 --> 00:13:08.411
Let's cheer up till the end!

00:13:08.412 --> 00:13:12.749
(Under the Hangang Bridge)
(Starting the filming for day 3!)

00:13:12.750 --> 00:13:15.043
(First scene)
(IAN&amp;A-NA's unit filming)

00:13:15.044 --> 00:13:17.003
(Feeling nervous)
What if I'm bad at riding it?

00:13:17.004 --> 00:13:18.380
It's cuter when you're not good at it

00:13:18.381 --> 00:13:20.215
Like shake shake

00:13:20.216 --> 00:13:21.466
I'll hold you well

00:13:21.467 --> 00:13:22.217
Really?

00:13:22.218 --> 00:13:23.218
(Nervous)
(Just trust me)

00:13:23.219 --> 00:13:25.971
(Swoosh)
(Moving forward)

00:13:25.972 --> 00:13:27.681
No, I got this!

00:13:30.349 --> 00:13:32.227
Think you'll bump into the director!

00:13:32.228 --> 00:13:33.267
(Doubtful of IAN's cycling skills)
Do you know how?

00:13:33.271 --> 00:13:34.187
No, no

00:13:34.188 --> 00:13:35.897
Don't be nervous, just go forward

00:13:35.898 --> 00:13:37.107
(Okay)

00:13:38.315 --> 00:13:39.985
(2nd time doubting)
Did you ride a bike when before?

00:13:39.986 --> 00:13:41.920
(Chit chat, blaming on A-NA)
It's because you're dragging me

00:13:41.921 --> 00:13:43.384
I was able to move forward

00:13:43.385 --> 00:13:44.197
What are you talking about

00:13:44.198 --> 00:13:46.366
Okay, I'll relax my hands once

00:13:46.367 --> 00:13:48.994
It'll all be good as long
as I ride the bike well

00:13:48.995 --> 00:13:50.787
(Yes yes)

00:13:50.788 --> 00:13:52.330
Why are you nodding?

00:13:52.331 --> 00:13:53.582
It is true though

00:13:53.583 --> 00:13:54.666
(Feeling sad)

00:13:54.667 --> 00:13:56.209
(In front of the filming site)
(The cyclists passing by)

00:13:56.210 --> 00:13:57.294
Yay

00:13:57.295 --> 00:13:58.545
Woah!

00:13:58.546 --> 00:14:01.506
(Got the energy)
(Cycling again)

00:14:04.967 --> 00:14:06.595
I'm doing well, right?

00:14:06.596 --> 00:14:11.224
(Improving in skills)

00:14:11.225 --> 00:14:13.476
(Proud)
Did so well by the end

00:14:13.477 --> 00:14:15.604
(Amazing)
It wasn't bad

00:14:15.605 --> 00:14:17.230
(Be like)
They filmed it for us well

00:14:17.231 --> 00:14:18.064
(Glare)

00:14:18.065 --> 00:14:21.067
Think this scene came out well
because they filmed it for us well

00:14:21.068 --> 00:14:23.194
Riding on the bike is so fun,
I feel like I just mastered it

00:14:25.821 --> 00:14:27.949
(Taking the bike away)
IAN said she won't ride on the bike anymore

00:14:27.950 --> 00:14:29.034
(Never heard it)
What are you talking about

00:14:29.035 --> 00:14:31.036
I told her don't you dare to even
pedal it

00:14:31.037 --> 00:14:32.412
But she's like then can I touch it

00:14:32.413 --> 00:14:34.789
(IAN's love for bicycle like)

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:37.500
On a day off once

00:14:37.501 --> 00:14:39.586
I ran by the Han River once!

00:14:39.587 --> 00:14:41.171
It was because I ate so much on that day

00:14:41.172 --> 00:14:42.881
and since I have to
go to work the day after

00:14:42.882 --> 00:14:46.051
I was like I can't just sleep like this
and came out to run

00:14:46.052 --> 00:14:48.136
But it was quite good

00:14:48.137 --> 00:14:51.973
(The first and the last day of running) It was
worth it once, but not sure if I'd do it again

00:14:51.974 --> 00:14:55.060
I have so much respect
for those of you who goes on running a lot

00:14:55.061 --> 00:14:56.061
(So much respect)

00:14:56.062 --> 00:14:57.771
(Anyways)
Let's cheer up today!

00:14:57.772 --> 00:15:02.192
(This scene)
(Running to a friend crossing the river)

00:15:09.907 --> 00:15:14.537
While we had a break, I checked the
map of where I went for jogging

00:15:14.538 --> 00:15:16.998
(Answer)
I went all the way to Yeongdongdaegyo

00:15:16.999 --> 00:15:19.334
(Ready to run again)

00:15:25.881 --> 00:15:29.511
It's our first group scene

00:15:29.512 --> 00:15:31.971
(With a chalk)
I'm drawing it here

00:15:31.972 --> 00:15:34.599
(Swoosh)

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:37.352
Isn't it cute? CARMEN
became a butterfly!

00:15:37.353 --> 00:15:40.271
(The sun's too bright)

00:15:40.272 --> 00:15:42.440
Cute, right? I did this

00:15:42.441 --> 00:15:43.775
(Bringing out her artistry)

00:15:43.776 --> 00:15:45.527
This is art!

00:15:45.528 --> 00:15:47.862
This is art!

00:15:50.489 --> 00:15:51.658
S

00:15:51.659 --> 00:15:53.076
2U

00:15:53.077 --> 00:15:55.245
(Love you)

00:15:56.453 --> 00:15:58.289
(Swoosh)

00:15:58.290 --> 00:15:59.457
(Checking)

00:15:59.458 --> 00:16:00.458
(JIWOO's confused)

00:16:00.459 --> 00:16:03.003
(Missed the timing to stand up)

00:16:03.003 --> 00:16:04.796
(Leaving)

00:16:17.224 --> 00:16:21.271
When I was little, I used to
play so much with crayons

00:16:21.272 --> 00:16:23.401
(Bringing back the memories)
It feels like I'm a child again

00:16:23.402 --> 00:16:24.607
It's so fun

00:16:34.700 --> 00:16:36.786
(Worried)
Feels like it'd be too bright for CARMEN

00:16:36.786 --> 00:16:37.912
(Right)

00:16:37.913 --> 00:16:39.998
(CARMEN, let's go!)

00:16:47.379 --> 00:16:50.175
Erasing with an alcohol cotton pad

00:16:50.176 --> 00:16:51.676
I'll erase it

00:16:53.343 --> 00:16:55.346
This feels good

00:16:55.347 --> 00:16:57.682
(Filming at an angle down to up)
(Unit filming starts!)

00:16:57.683 --> 00:16:58.892
(Ready)

00:16:58.893 --> 00:17:00.060
(Shook)

00:17:00.061 --> 00:17:01.352
(Funny reviewing it on the camera)

00:17:09.902 --> 00:17:11.946
IAN, could you go bend down more
than what you did now?

00:17:11.947 --> 00:17:13.198
(Got it)

00:17:15.699 --> 00:17:17.786
(Swoosh)

00:17:17.786 --> 00:17:20.163
(A group photo with Pikachu too)

00:17:20.164 --> 00:17:21.998
(CARMEN attack with the ears)

00:17:21.999 --> 00:17:23.833
My head!

00:17:23.834 --> 00:17:25.210
(Holding hands)

00:17:25.211 --> 00:17:27.045
(Hugs)

00:17:27.046 --> 00:17:30.006
Pikachu, could you move your left ear

00:17:30.007 --> 00:17:31.925
(Ear shake)

00:17:31.926 --> 00:17:32.927
(Loving the Pikachu moves)

00:17:32.928 --> 00:17:34.511
How old are you?

00:17:34.512 --> 00:17:35.970
(Cute!)

00:17:36.970 --> 00:17:41.226
It's filled with stuff to make
my bag look packed

00:17:41.227 --> 00:17:44.646
(Showing the secrets)
What's in my bag?

00:17:44.647 --> 00:17:47.065
(An empty water bottle)
Water bottle?

00:17:47.066 --> 00:17:51.069
(Lots of stuff) Don't know what they
are, but it's filled with stuff

00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:54.572
(What items did you carry around
when you were a student?) I carry lots

00:17:54.573 --> 00:17:58.993
I always bring a scissor in my pencil case
in case I need it

00:17:58.994 --> 00:18:01.037
and a notebook, to write down notes

00:18:01.038 --> 00:18:02.747
(The handouts)
This folder

00:18:02.748 --> 00:18:04.499
I used to bring those with me

00:18:04.500 --> 00:18:05.725
(Coach STELLA, master cyclist here)

00:18:05.726 --> 00:18:08.128
I'll go back

00:18:08.129 --> 00:18:12.173
My dream since I was a trainee was
to ride the bicycle by the Han River

00:18:12.174 --> 00:18:13.842
(Dreams will come true)
But I've never tried it

00:18:13.843 --> 00:18:16.886
I'll be riding on the bike
after we film this scene

00:18:16.887 --> 00:18:19.264
(Let's go ride it together, S2U)
Let's go together

00:18:19.265 --> 00:18:20.653
(Swoosh)

00:18:20.654 --> 00:18:22.725
Hi!

00:18:23.976 --> 00:18:26.146
(Looking for my missing bike...)
Where did it go

00:18:29.690 --> 00:18:31.025
Look at YE-ON once

00:18:31.026 --> 00:18:31.818
(YE-ON...)

00:18:32.401 --> 00:18:33.528
(Just looking at each other
brings joy)

00:18:35.404 --> 00:18:37.031
Our youngest YE-ON

00:18:37.032 --> 00:18:37.907
Our youngest YE-ON's being rebellious

00:18:37.908 --> 00:18:39.242
Say a word for us here

00:18:39.243 --> 00:18:44.247
In the scene we just filmed,
I had to lean on YUHA's shoulders

00:18:44.248 --> 00:18:46.207
(Pat)
But it was too low

00:18:46.208 --> 00:18:47.709
I couldn't lean on her

00:18:47.710 --> 00:18:48.918
(Just kidding)

00:18:48.919 --> 00:18:50.753
So...okay!

00:18:50.754 --> 00:18:51.880
(Hmmph)
Then don't lean on me

00:18:51.881 --> 00:18:53.006
(Why not)

00:18:53.007 --> 00:18:55.592
(Chit chat) - Then don't lean on me,
get off me then / - I was kidding

00:18:55.593 --> 00:18:58.928
(And here)
(The girls still riding on the bike)

00:18:58.929 --> 00:19:00.221
(Too fast)
Wait for me

00:19:00.222 --> 00:19:01.431
Okay, hurry!

00:19:02.431 --> 00:19:05.602
(Tattle telling S2U)
She kept riding on the bike too fast

00:19:05.603 --> 00:19:07.729
You had to catch up with me

00:19:07.730 --> 00:19:10.773
(Riding on the bike by the Han River)
(Dream came true)

00:19:10.774 --> 00:19:15.195
(And the promo too)
Please send lots of love to 'Pretty Please'!

00:19:17.696 --> 00:19:22.493
(And finally started)
(The first group choreography scene today)

00:19:26.663 --> 00:19:29.584
(Got confused with the alignment)

00:19:34.421 --> 00:19:36.758
(The hand off)

00:19:36.759 --> 00:19:40.261
(Next TAKE too, let's go!)

00:19:42.221 --> 00:19:43.765
Let's go!

00:20:07.746 --> 00:20:10.375
While dancing, spot on the camera

00:20:10.376 --> 00:20:12.794
and look at the camera, that'd be great

00:20:12.795 --> 00:20:14.629
(Got it)

00:20:17.256 --> 00:20:18.925
So I go like this and look that way

00:20:18.926 --> 00:20:19.884
(Practicing it first)

00:20:19.885 --> 00:20:21.761
A-NA, turn with a cool pose
at the end!

00:20:21.762 --> 00:20:23.680
(Yep!)

00:20:23.681 --> 00:20:26.724
(Filming with the director's feedback)

00:20:35.649 --> 00:20:39.279
(This time)
(Looking this way while stretching)

00:20:39.280 --> 00:20:41.281
(Remembering it once more
before filming)

00:20:54.793 --> 00:20:57.755
(This was filmed while the car has stopped)
We just finished filming at the first spot

00:20:57.756 --> 00:21:04.304
For the line 'How it's so simple
All of this, our favorite scenes'

00:21:04.305 --> 00:21:10.268
I was lying on the ground
for the scene, doing the lip sync there

00:21:10.269 --> 00:21:15.898
(Too sunny) But the sunlight was too
strong, I couldn't open my eyes

00:21:15.899 --> 00:21:19.277
So we had to film that scene multiple times

00:21:19.278 --> 00:21:22.905
(Sorry, members)
So I felt so bad to our members

00:21:22.906 --> 00:21:25.742
So I was a bit sad

00:21:25.743 --> 00:21:27.201
(Pat pat)
(Was sad, but did well!)

00:21:27.202 --> 00:21:32.623
We just finished filming
for the group choreography scene

00:21:32.624 --> 00:21:35.251
Anyway, the weather's so nice today too

00:21:35.252 --> 00:21:39.172
(You know what I mean)
It's hot, but it feels nice, you know

00:21:39.173 --> 00:21:42.133
so we're doing our best for the filming

00:21:42.134 --> 00:21:47.597
But I'm a bit sad that today's the
last day

00:21:47.598 --> 00:21:50.391
It's by the Han River here

00:21:50.392 --> 00:21:53.519
so it's so relaxing just being here

00:21:53.520 --> 00:21:55.188
(Moved to a different spot)

00:21:55.189 --> 00:21:56.814
(A different view from earlier)

00:21:56.815 --> 00:21:59.650
Can't believe we're filming on the bridge!

00:21:59.651 --> 00:22:03.404
We got on the bridge by the Han River

00:22:03.405 --> 00:22:06.282
And this spot is quite narrow

00:22:06.283 --> 00:22:09.368
But we'll do our best!

00:22:09.369 --> 00:22:14.624
(This scene)
(JIWOO runs and drops a keyring)

00:22:14.625 --> 00:22:16.793
(My keying...!)

00:22:16.794 --> 00:22:19.587
(Run run)

00:22:19.588 --> 00:22:23.424
(Hello)

00:22:23.425 --> 00:22:25.885
(On the bridge)
(Photo time's a must)

00:22:33.600 --> 00:22:35.436
(Checking)

00:22:35.437 --> 00:22:37.397
(Love it)
Woah!

00:22:37.398 --> 00:22:39.023
It's nice

00:22:39.024 --> 00:22:43.319
(And capture time for S2U)

00:22:48.156 --> 00:22:49.575
(Hehe)

00:22:49.576 --> 00:22:53.663
(The odd silhouette)

00:22:53.664 --> 00:22:56.249
(Embarrassed)
No!

00:22:56.250 --> 00:22:58.835
This isn't visible, right?

00:22:58.836 --> 00:23:01.546
Would anyone notice it?

00:23:01.547 --> 00:23:04.382
(Got something on the sleeve, got caught...)

00:23:04.383 --> 00:23:06.968
(Got dark)
(the bridge feels even cooler)

00:23:06.969 --> 00:23:08.469
(Here)

00:23:08.469 --> 00:23:09.846
(with S2U)

00:23:09.847 --> 00:23:11.514
(I want to come here with you)

00:23:12.097 --> 00:23:14.016
(Hop hop...)

00:23:14.017 --> 00:23:16.060
It's so pretty here, Han River

00:23:16.061 --> 00:23:21.357
I couldn't say this before
because I had to go filming

00:23:21.358 --> 00:23:26.070
but I was saying it's so pretty here,
I wanted to come here next time with my family

00:23:26.071 --> 00:23:28.239
And with S2U

00:23:28.240 --> 00:23:29.657
(Hehe)

00:23:29.658 --> 00:23:34.036
I remember I went to Han River a lot
with A-NA when I was a trainee

00:23:34.037 --> 00:23:37.373
I'd come to Han River with A-NA
and get like chicken

00:23:37.374 --> 00:23:40.793
and eat ramyeon and Han River to talk
about life

00:23:40.794 --> 00:23:44.172
And there wasn't much to talk about
life and of course not much now either

00:23:44.173 --> 00:23:45.882
But we had like this routine

00:23:45.883 --> 00:23:48.718
(A-NA&amp;IAN's routine 1. Eat by Konkuk Univ. Station)
Eat near Konkuk Univ. Station

00:23:48.719 --> 00:23:51.679
(2. and eat again at Han River)
And eat again at Han River

00:23:51.680 --> 00:23:54.098
(And wrapped it up with chat &amp; selfie time)
and we'd chat and take photos

00:23:54.099 --> 00:23:56.350
It feels different and new

00:23:56.351 --> 00:23:58.352
coming here with our members now

00:23:58.353 --> 00:24:01.981
(Hello)

00:24:04.524 --> 00:24:05.735
(Look over there!)

00:24:07.444 --> 00:24:10.448
(Now in a line)
(group choreography filming starts!)

00:24:19.998 --> 00:24:23.461
(Continuing on)
(Running down the stairs)

00:24:30.634 --> 00:24:32.929
I usually don't get tired like this

00:24:32.930 --> 00:24:36.432
(Was a hard fitness test)

00:24:36.433 --> 00:24:42.355
(And the running scene again)

00:24:42.356 --> 00:24:46.317
(The other direction this time)

00:24:48.276 --> 00:24:49.111
Ahhh

00:24:51.279 --> 00:24:53.157
(The reason they're shocked)
There are cicadas here

00:24:53.158 --> 00:24:55.993
Do you know those cicada shells?

00:24:55.994 --> 00:24:57.954
(Shell...?)

00:24:57.954 --> 00:24:59.247
It's like transparent

00:24:59.248 --> 00:25:00.414
(Pat!)
It was there like this

00:25:00.415 --> 00:25:01.749
Isn't that called an exuvia?

00:25:01.750 --> 00:25:02.541
Right, exuvia!

00:25:03.708 --> 00:25:05.545
The evidence of the remain

00:25:05.546 --> 00:25:07.129
Let's move on!

00:25:07.130 --> 00:25:11.884
(Done with the running scene!)

00:25:11.885 --> 00:25:15.137
(Discussing)

00:25:15.138 --> 00:25:18.349
When I was a trainee, I've been
told I'm like this sassy Seoul girl

00:25:18.350 --> 00:25:22.061
and when I said I wanted to
have that 'pure vibes', people didn't believe me

00:25:22.062 --> 00:25:25.606
but after debut, it became the opposite

00:25:25.607 --> 00:25:29.318
(Rural vibes) People tell
me I look I'm from the country side more

00:25:29.319 --> 00:25:30.694
they told me that more

00:25:30.695 --> 00:25:34.990
so I was wondering why that
has changed

00:25:34.991 --> 00:25:37.493
so I was talking to JUUN
who's been with me since trainee days

00:25:37.494 --> 00:25:39.328
so I was about to tell you guys that

00:25:39.329 --> 00:25:42.164
But I feel like it might
be because I have short hair now

00:25:42.165 --> 00:25:46.210
(JIWOO with short hair, got different vibes)
Many told me I look nicer with short hair

00:25:46.211 --> 00:25:47.253
What do you think?

00:25:47.254 --> 00:25:49.380
(Agreed)
The hairstyle affected a lot

00:25:50.004 --> 00:25:55.261
(Final filming today)
(group choreography scene starts!)

00:26:38.303 --> 00:26:40.556
This was Hearts2Hearts!

00:26:40.557 --> 00:26:42.683
Thank you!

00:26:44.809 --> 00:26:47.730
(A cute gift)
(prepared by the Pokemon team)

00:26:47.731 --> 00:26:51.275
(Touched)
(Thank you)

00:26:51.276 --> 00:26:54.069
('Pretty Please')
(MV filming, done!)

00:26:54.070 --> 00:26:56.572
We're done with filming the
'Pretty Please' MV!

00:26:58.031 --> 00:26:59.533
Thank you so much, everyone!

00:26:59.534 --> 00:27:01.035
(Thank you, everyone!)

00:27:01.036 --> 00:27:03.412
So many people worked so hard

00:27:03.413 --> 00:27:06.040
with us together, in such hot weather too

00:27:06.041 --> 00:27:08.083
so I'm sure the MV will come
out really well

00:27:08.084 --> 00:27:10.127
(Wishing all the hard work comes to fruit)
That's right

00:27:10.128 --> 00:27:11.086
Thank you!

00:27:11.087 --> 00:27:12.713
Please watch it lots!

00:27:12.714 --> 00:27:14.757
Please send lots of love to 'Pretty Please'

00:27:14.758 --> 00:27:17.009
(Please get excited for Pokémon LEGENDS Z-A」 as well!)

00:27:17.010 --> 00:27:20.846
(Please send lots of love to 'Pretty Please')
Thank you, members, bye bye

